Ok, so the 0.8.0 is real, which means that the Trojan Horse theory is false
Here’s the dealio for what’s been happening these past couple weeks, to get you up to speed
Basically, the 5th anniversary of Friday Night Funkin’ came around on October 5th/6th and leading up to that point, fans were speculating
About what, you ask, well, week 8, of course
One fan, whose Twitter name is markedaman, presented a theory that explained the hidden update in 0.7.6
Essentially, the theory said that 0.7.6 was actually 0.8.0 in disguise, due to the certain phrase used within the milestone
Unfortunately, or fortunately if you’re me, said theory has now been debunked with the release of 0.8.0 this week
It has one issue, but after 0.7.6 is finished, more will be added, or even before that time too
It was a fun theory to believe in, and the FNF devs played along with their teaser trailer posted on TikTok, but it’s now done

Despite some fans being upset that Trojan horse was a lie, we did get some new music teased in the form of a pinata
