Either way, I present a theory that’s not anything new (FrostyToons made it before, I’ve mentioning it here because why not)
This theory suggests that in 0.8.0, there will be ten songs because of the ten candies within the pinata in the second teaser
Three (or four) of those songs could the Week 8 songs, two are DEFINITELY the Week 4 Pico Mixes, but what about the other 4
2 could be the mixes for Lit and Blazing BF Remix (as those have been confirmed already by Mr. PhantomArcade aka Dave)
The other 2 could be the Erect Remixes for the Weekend update (Lit Up and either 2Hot or Blazin)
